Tieton Painting App
Tieton Painting Application
I worked at Startup Business Group (SBG) at Microsoft on a painting application codenamed 'Tieton'. It eventually shipped, in a different form, as Microsoft Fresh Paint.
Beside here are examples of the alpha app design as well as visual explorations for the interface inspired by contemporary fine art technique. The alpha debuted at MOMA in New York for two months. Allowing visitors to use it helped us to gather research and stress-test the app.
